WEBVTT

00:01.200 --> 00:03.000
NIGHT MANAGER: Evening.

00:03.300 --> 00:07.600
NIGHT MANAGER: Found something special in the returns.

00:08.000 --> 00:11.200
NIGHT MANAGER: Do mind the label.

00:16.000 --> 00:19.000
COLLECTOR: Let's see what you are.

00:54.000 --> 00:56.000
COLLECTOR: What?

01:47.600 --> 01:50.000
NIGHT MANAGER: You forgot to rewind.

01:50.800 --> 01:53.400
NIGHT MANAGER: Another satisfied customer.

01:53.600 --> 01:57.800
NIGHT MANAGER: Membership... permanent.
